  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Tobacco use disorder, severe: about twenty cigars a day for about fifty years, with many failed attempts to stop; synthetic modern episode linked to his documented cigar smoking</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>F17.290</td><td>S — Synthetic modern coding; person-first language; not a claim about his real diagnosis.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-2">
