    <title>Physical Exam</title>
    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2026-06-15; see the referring visit&apos;s Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mouth</td><td>Right partial maxillectomy defect with a healthy lining; 4 mm shallow ulcer with a clean base at the anterior margin where the flange presses; no induration, mass, or white or red patch; remaining upper and lower teeth with tobacco staining and two areas of root caries</td></tr><tr><td>Prosthesis</td><td>Acrylic obturator worn, porous and stained, with a gap at the posterior lateral seal and an overextended anterior flange</td></tr><tr><td>Speech</td><td>Hypernasal resonance and audible nasal emission with the obturator in; better after the reline</td></tr><tr><td>Neck</td><td>No lymph nodes felt</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

